graph LR
    Praxis["praxis-extproc<br/>(payload-pre-processing + payload-processing)"]

    %% Rust / runtime dependencies
    Praxis -->|filter framework| PraxisCore["praxis-proxy-core / filter 0.7.4"]
    Praxis -->|AI filters| PraxisAI["praxis-ai-filters v0.9.0<br/>(git praxis-proxy/ai)"]
    Praxis -->|OpenSSL rustls provider| PraxisTLS["praxis-proxy-tls 0.7.3"]
    Praxis -->|gRPC server| Tonic["tonic / tonic-health 0.14.6"]
    Praxis -->|async runtime| Tokio["tokio =1.53.3"]
    Praxis -->|TLS termination| OpenSSLCrate["openssl / tokio-openssl"]
    Praxis -->|TokenReview / SAR| Kube["kube 5.0.0"]
    Praxis -->|metrics| MetricsCrate["metrics-exporter-prometheus"]
    Praxis -->|crypto primitives| SysOpenSSL["System OpenSSL<br/>UBI 9 minimal PQC"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    Gateway["MaaS Gateway Envoy<br/>Istio / OSSM 3"] -->|ext_proc gRPC 9004 TLS| Praxis
    Controller["ai-gateway-controller / MaaS"] -->|deploys overlay, MaasTenantConfig| Praxis
    Praxis -.->|filter ordering| Kuadrant["Kuadrant<br/>Authorino / Limitador"]
    Praxis -.->|route exclusion| MaasAPI["maas-api"]
    Praxis -->|X-Gateway-Model-Name contract| KServe["KServe LLMInferenceService"]
    Praxis -.->|EPP ext_proc re-insertion| EPP["Gateway API Inference Extension EPP"]
    ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"] -->|serving-cert Secrets| Praxis
    Prometheus["RHOAI Prometheus"] -->|scrapes 9090| Praxis

    %% External services
    Praxis -->|HTTPS 443/6443| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API server"]
    Reloader["Stakater Reloader (optional)"] -.->|restart on rotation| Praxis

